  "content": {
    "visible_text": "Skip to Content About Schedule Youth Program FAQs Contact < back Muay Thai Coach ERic Competition Experience: Amateur fights: 3 Semi-Contact Matches (MDL/PKB): 7 Coaching Experience: 3+ years of Muay Thai coaching at CMA Youth Program Assistant Director Eric started training Muay Thai as a teenager over a decade ago with Coach Joe. After developing his skill and passion, he joined the fight team and began competing locally. He has since transitioned to coaching beginner and intermediate adults and children, helping them to find love in the sport the same way he did. He also enjoys providing direct one-on-one private training to students. Available for Private Coaching Name First Name (required) Last Name (required) Phone Email (required) Message (required) Submit Schedule About Newsletter Pricing FAQ s hello@cmasf.com I ‍  ‍ (415) 359-9294 ‍   ‍ 1217 Polk,  San Francisco",
